- You guys wanna hangout?

00:00:23.814 --> 00:00:25.199
♪ It's so good ♪

00:00:25.199 --> 00:00:27.577
♪ Got me up on this feeling ♪

00:00:27.577 --> 00:00:30.244
♪ It's so good ♪

00:00:37.411 --> 00:00:40.078
(ambient music)

00:01:00.425 --> 00:01:01.654
- This is the best day of my life.

00:01:01.654 --> 00:01:03.648
I can die happy now.

00:01:03.648 --> 00:01:05.762
- So overwhelming.

00:01:05.762 --> 00:01:07.688
- You can clickbait this!

00:01:07.688 --> 00:01:09.990
- [Tour Guide] Welcome
aboard ladies and gentlemen,

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:14.268
appreciate y'all coming
on the tour with us.

00:01:14.268 --> 00:01:17.301
- We're about to start the tour, right?

00:01:17.301 --> 00:01:18.400
- [Woman] That's right.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:20.480
- [Tour Guide] Just tryna
check the sound balances

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:22.100
of my microphone.

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:24.790
All right, we're getting
ready to make a right turn

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:26.530
on Highland Avenue right here.

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:30.200
Now what you seeing in front
of you is the Dolby Theatre.

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.816
Dolby Theatre is where
the Oscars are held.

00:01:32.816 --> 00:01:35.399
(upbeat music)

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:46.970
- We were supposed to
go see the Dolby Theatre

00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:49.638
but we missed the turn, I guess.

00:01:49.638 --> 00:01:53.403
This driver doesn't
really seem to know much.

00:01:55.517 --> 00:01:56.697
- [Tour Guide] Forgive us.

00:01:56.697 --> 00:01:58.653
As I said, this is our main voyage,

00:01:59.716 --> 00:02:04.260
got stuck in a loop here a
little bit but bear with us.

00:02:05.333 --> 00:02:10.333
- What is happening?

00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:12.937
- [Man] Aww, that's so cool!

00:02:12.937 --> 00:02:14.937
- What's that?
- Hawkins

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:17.767
- [Tour Guide] Ladies and gentlemen,

00:02:17.767 --> 00:02:19.120
we're gonna have to stop.

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:22.037
(electronic music)

00:02:23.488 --> 00:02:25.821
(screaming)

00:02:30.694 --> 00:02:33.457
- Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

00:02:33.457 --> 00:02:38.100
Listen to me, listen,
listen to me, listen to me.

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:43.100
I'm local law enforcement
in this part of town, okay.

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:45.240
You're clearly near Hawkins, Indiana.

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:47.370
So why don't we go take a
stop and get some ice cream?

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:49.950
Does everybody like ice-cream?

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:52.847
Driver, can we go around the corner?

00:02:52.847 --> 00:02:55.020
- Jim Hopper yo, Jim Hopper!
- Can we go around the corner?

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:57.381
I gotta ice cream spot I wanna stop at.

00:02:57.381 --> 00:03:00.298
(electronic music)

00:03:14.832 --> 00:03:15.966
- [Interviewer] How are
you feeling right now?

00:03:15.966 --> 00:03:17.049
- Very good!

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:21.328
- We got there and we
all had panic attacks.

00:03:21.328 --> 00:03:22.842
I was just so overwhelmed,

00:03:22.842 --> 00:03:25.250
like I can't believe that they were there

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:28.704
and we got to see them in front of us.

00:03:28.704 --> 00:03:30.220
- [David Harbour] Hey guys, guys!

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:32.870
Do you guys wanna get some
ice cream at Scoops Ahoy!?

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:34.930
- This is so much better

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:36.792
than what I thought it was gonna be.

00:03:36.792 --> 00:03:39.286
- [Woman] I thought I was
gonna die on this tour.

00:03:39.286 --> 00:03:41.310
- C'mon everybody off the bus,

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:43.860
everybody has to eat ice cream.

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:44.693
Look at this!

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:48.163
Literally oceans of flavor!

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:53.370
Now listen, we're gonna
have to say goodbye

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:55.168
for like three minutes.

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:58.085
(crowd chattering)

00:04:04.364 --> 00:04:06.040
Come Joe, come Gaten, come.

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:07.352
Come, come, come, come, come!

00:04:07.352 --> 00:04:09.935
(upbeat music)

00:04:11.983 --> 00:04:13.662
(crowd chattering)

00:04:13.662 --> 00:04:14.776
All right listen, for those of you

00:04:14.776 --> 00:04:16.612
