00:04:16.612 --> 00:04:19.445
(crowd screaming)

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:27.227
I have a couple new
employees from Scoops Ahoy!

00:04:30.713 --> 00:04:33.630
(crowd chattering)

00:04:42.816 --> 00:04:45.975
- Literally my favorite show for two years

00:04:45.975 --> 00:04:47.808
and I literally can't.

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:51.160
- I got a call from
their principal last year

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:54.270
that Emily got caught watching season two.

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:57.860
- I watched it in my
photo class, my study hall

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.661
and in my math Class,

00:04:59.661 --> 00:05:03.120
and my principal found out
and got really mad at me,

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:05.750
and they tried to take my phone.

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:07.500
- We pretty much give you guys ice cream

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:08.834
is what I'm thinking.

00:05:08.834 --> 00:05:11.478
- [Woman] Okay I want some.

00:05:11.478 --> 00:05:14.061
(upbeat music)

00:05:15.465 --> 00:05:18.090
(crowd chattering)

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:20.292
- Hi, how are you?

00:05:20.292 --> 00:05:21.875
Oh I love you both!

00:05:23.803 --> 00:05:25.326
- [Interviewer] How are you feeling mate?

00:05:25.326 --> 00:05:27.020
- I'm shaking!

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:29.263
- [Interviewer] You're
flipping out, aren't you?

00:05:31.396 --> 00:05:33.396
- Thank you!
- Thank you!

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:36.677
- [Gaten Matarazzo] I did it again!

00:05:36.677 --> 00:05:37.510
Nah, I didn't even do it before.

00:05:37.510 --> 00:05:38.343
- [Joe Keery] That's okay!

00:05:38.343 --> 00:05:39.500
- Actually, it didn't tip over

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:43.673
so we're good.
- Amateur.

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:48.270
Give me one of these bears!

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:51.506
