00:05:59.614 --> 00:06:00.447
A big photo will be taken.

00:06:03.745 --> 00:06:05.635
- Okay, we have to have the tickets!

00:06:05.635 --> 00:06:07.642
We can't take the picture
without the tickets!

00:06:07.642 --> 00:06:09.220
- Oh yeah, we got the
passes right, for tomorrow?

00:06:11.217 --> 00:06:12.589
(crowd screaming)

00:06:12.589 --> 00:06:14.652
- You guys are going to the premiere!

00:06:14.652 --> 00:06:17.485
(crowd screaming)

00:06:27.929 --> 00:06:29.025
- We're in disbelief right now

00:06:29.025 --> 00:06:30.691
because of what just happened.

00:06:30.691 --> 00:06:31.780
When we saw David, like c'mon now!

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:37.230
- I'm tryna process this in my head

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:39.654
- [Woman] It was worth missing work today

00:06:39.654 --> 00:06:41.700
- Yes, thank you guys really!

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:43.950
- June 27th folks, a day
we will never forget.

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:45.452
- Yeah.
- That's right.

00:06:45.452 --> 00:06:48.369
